WEBVTT

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:34.680
Mr. Gareth, I have discovered the existence of the spirit.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.180
It's too late.

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:39.460
There is a small village nearby.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:41.380
You can use the residents there.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:42.700
Hmm?

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:50.040
With this, I will obtain the power of Elysium.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.420
And the world will be in my hands.

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:09.540
Oh, my God.

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:11.510
Oh, my God.

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:46.950
You're a weakling, you're a weakling!

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:48.950
You're a weakling, you're a weakling!

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:52.360
You lost the game of food, so you're not eating!

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:57.080
You're a weakling, you're a weakling!

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:02.890
Hey, if you're going to say that, then from now on,

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.360
I'll eat it myself!

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:09.060
That's a different story!

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:11.570
We're both humans, aren't we?

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:41.750
While you were eating, you picked up your luggage and chose the Dina Inverse.

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:16.760
I don't even know what I'm talking about.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:21.320
I'm sure it's because you're running away from me.

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:24.120
I'll pay you a lot for this.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:28.970
For the time being, I'll treat you to a good meal.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:42.130
Don't tell me you got caught up in that explosion?

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.760
What are you talking about?

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:20.120
I know how to take care of my wounds.

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:21.120
You mean the one from Yaguraka?

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:24.730
No, you...

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:25.410
Well, well...

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:26.430
That's why...

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:27.690
That's why...

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:38.940
That's what happened.

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:43.860
A group of people who brought Sir Damon suddenly came and threatened the people of the village.

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:50.300
I'm going to get my eyes on my people.

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:12.520
That's why I ran away.

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:14.910
I see.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:46.030
We will praise you for the power of this serpent and the power of your hand.

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:49.660
That hand...

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:05.580
When you ask for something, you need to be grateful for it.

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:10.400
I don't have much money, but...

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:10.760
Where?

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.850
But I'll pay you separately.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:20.840
The village where I live, Biatsu, is about half a day away from this town.

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:23.130
It's in the mountains.

00:07:24.050 --> 00:07:25.720
Biatsu...

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:29.940
I don't care about the name, but I'm going to be grateful for the famous pickles for a year.

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:31.140
I don't want to be called an idiot.

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:34.050
Rinna, we have no choice but to do it.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:35.230
Good.

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:37.710
Alright!

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:38.780
I'll give it to you this time!

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:41.080
Yeah!

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:45.440
I won't leave you alone!

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:11.400
We'll do our best to help you.

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:12.950
Be happy!

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:15.530
Get to work!

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:19.340
I'm the director.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:21.710
I'm a great swordsman.

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:22.590
Okay.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:27.040
I get it, but...

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:29.190
Why are you following me?

00:08:29.430 --> 00:08:29.830
Stop complaining.

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:31.070
Even though I told you to come with me.

00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:35.370
If you come with me, it's not like you have to come with me.

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:36.950
There's no way I have to come with you.

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:39.120
Well then, let's go.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:44.830
If we fight in a place like this, the village will be in a mess.

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:48.200
First of all, we need to check the number of enemies and their power.

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:01.740
I've read in a magic book.

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:05.440
Once upon a time, there was an elf village nearby.

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:08.340
The village chief was entrusted with something.

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:10.500
That means...

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:12.070
It suits you. It suits you.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.560
This is a treasure chest?

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:15.200
That person, isn't she?

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:19.530
It's really...

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:48.020
It was raining a few days ago, and they came out from under the cliff.

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:53.320
In order to dig that up, they forced the villagers to work.

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:57.820
Oh, what are they trying to dig up?

00:09:58.760 --> 00:09:59.440
Right?

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:00.980
That's good.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:02.620
No, that's not good.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:05.790
Right now, the only way to save the villagers is bloodshed.

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:10.720
Do you hear me?

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:24.580
I think we'll be able to see it when we get to the store.

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:27.740
It seems so.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.960
Hurry up and look.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.180
I think I'll have to show it to you.

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:32.890
Your sword skills.

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:46.400
So you've noticed me.

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:50.310
Looks like you've also noticed me.

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:53.150
You're doing something terrible.

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:55.570
No, I'm not.

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:56.350
I'm doing it properly.

00:10:57.310 --> 00:10:58.990
Well, I don't get paid.

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:02.180
If you think we can save the world,

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:06.540
you should be grateful to us.

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:08.460
What did you say?

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:13.280
You're talking big again.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:14.560
Don't say that.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:17.280
You can't even borrow a villager.

00:11:19.310 --> 00:11:22.370
You can't even laugh at the world.

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:28.840
Shut up!

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:34.180
I thought I'd do it myself, but I can't do it alone!

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:39.840
I won't die here, Lesser Demon!

00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:40.600
Do it!

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:05.530
It's about time for you to get serious about it.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:09.490
Or is it a pity to say that you're serious about what you just said?

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.930
Hey, I'm going to tell you today!

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:14.690
Remember!

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:16.180
Remember!

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:27.370
Before you come back...

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:28.540
I...

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:35.440
I wonder if the two of them are really okay.

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:39.040
They ran away, and now there's a guard in vain.

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:44.380
That's right. There's a strong ally.

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:49.100
But I don't think anyone's going to leave.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:52.160
I wonder if the guys who knocked them down just now had a guard.

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:56.070
It doesn't matter. There's no one who's not there.

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:58.070
More than that.

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:06.380
If you tell me to teach you, you won't understand, will you?

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:10.080
Are you still going to stay in this country?

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:13.110
I know that this is a treasure.

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:18.410
It's not a treasure.

00:14:18.510 --> 00:14:25.330
If you ask me to teach you, I'll do it.

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:28.800
You can't ask me to teach you, can you?

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:32.760
Is it related to the Elves?

00:14:35.230 --> 00:14:41.260
There was an Elven hideout around here.

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:44.450
When the Elves moved somewhere,

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:47.310
I asked the village chief of my village to protect it.

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:48.840
That's why it was here.

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:52.610
I didn't expect this to be buried.

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:55.890
So, what is this?

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:58.880
I don't know.

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:01.090
But the Elves kept saying,

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.620
Don't ever touch this land.

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:06.540
If you do, the village will be destroyed.

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:09.930
If this land is protected,

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:12.480
the village of Beards will develop.

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:26.320
This is the proof of the promise.

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:28.160
The Elves sent me a letter.

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:29.700
It's a letter from the village chief.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:31.210
That's what I've been told.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:36.480
My father is the head of this village.

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:42.510
I don't know, but...

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:56.220
Don't you think about what you did when you were young?

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:57.620
Don't you lack money?

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:05.110
It's pretty solid, isn't it?

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:08.720
But anyway, it's a village thing, so please return it.

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:11.370
I'll do my best to make up for the inconvenience.

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:13.440
It can't be helped if you go out so honestly.

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:31.030
Stop it!

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:32.530
Just a moment!

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:36.300
This is how you do it...

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:38.440
Eh, eh, eh...

00:16:38.440 --> 00:16:45.620
This is how you do it!

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.630
I told the detective that I'm the one who's going to do it!

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:03.800
I've never heard of anyone who's done something like that before.

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:39.520
Hey, Salina, are you sure you're okay? Leave it to those two.

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:42.310
Don't hurt me.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:48.840
So, it's been a day.

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:50.420
You're a troublesome opponent.

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:51.930
I'm sorry.

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:55.290
The little girl who ran away before brought such a mercenary.

00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:58.090
It can't be helped even if you say that.

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:06.460
But if I can't leave them alone, I'll call my former subordinates.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:10.850
Are they... too dangerous?

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:13.000
You are...

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:16.800
too dangerous!

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:21.000
Kyaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:40.910
It looks like it's going to rain today.

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:45.170
It's going to rain like crazy.

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:46.120
Dad!

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:51.100
Let go of me!

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:53.330
Don't say that.

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:56.360
I thought you were going to come to this village right away.

00:18:57.020 --> 00:18:58.590
It's been two days since then.

00:18:58.590 --> 00:18:59.160
There's no movement.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:00.760
He must have gone somewhere.

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:03.390
Maybe he's waiting for us.

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:08.380
If you don't want to wait, why don't you wait here?

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.740
You don't know where his office is, do you?

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:15.170
I know where his office is.

00:19:18.310 --> 00:19:23.260
I'll show you around.

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:26.240
I'll treat you to a drink later.

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:28.860
Get me a snack.

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:30.860
It's wet!

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:34.530
I wonder if it's wet.

00:19:34.590 --> 00:19:35.030
Ugh!

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:38.690
It doesn't have to be at a time like this when it's about to start raining.

00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:41.770
No, it's not like that.

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:44.500
But I'm sorry to get wet in the rain.

00:19:45.020 --> 00:19:46.220
I'm...

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:47.500
Well, yeah.

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:49.430
Kani.

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:16.090
What do you think?

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:16.770
What do you mean?

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:18.440
What Rufus told me.

00:20:18.460 --> 00:20:20.550
I don't know what it is, but I'm sure it's Otakami.

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.130
I'm sure of it.

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:26.160
There's no way you're going to dig it up.

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:29.020
The enemy must know something.

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:29.980
I'm sure.

00:20:30.030 --> 00:20:32.170
I see. So you're going to catch him and make him confess, right?

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:33.740
Don't say anything bad about it.

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:36.420
Just lower your head and let me know.

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:36.880
Hmm.

00:20:37.550 --> 00:20:43.380
What? It's almost time.

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:47.470
I've heard that line from the beginning, Bigger-san.

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:48.990
I mean, this time, it's true.

00:20:49.610 --> 00:20:50.270
That's what I've been saying.

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:51.370
Where?

00:20:52.590 --> 00:20:53.650
See, that's it.

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:00.840
I'll take care of the servants you hired.

00:21:31.340 --> 00:21:34.390
Let's go to the head office.

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:42.110
I don't want you to judge me.

00:21:43.890 --> 00:21:49.870
The head office is still small.

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:52.870
The head office is like this, and there are two members.

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:55.780
I'm in trouble, and I don't have money.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:01.150
Don't worry about it, old man.

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:05.190
I'm not making an organization just for the sake of my life!

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:08.130
The goal is to live as I please.

00:22:09.690 --> 00:22:13.580
That's too early to say, but you're making an organization in the middle of nowhere, aren't you?

00:22:13.580 --> 00:22:14.020
Not really.

00:22:14.960 --> 00:22:19.920
It's a small organization now, but if I could make something that sleeps in this land into my own hands,

00:22:20.300 --> 00:22:21.680
it wouldn't be a dream to conquer the world!

00:22:22.810 --> 00:22:23.490
No way!

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:27.050
You're in my way!

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:35.360
Bring power to me from the darkness of the human heart!

00:22:35.860 --> 00:22:38.780
You're going to give it to me and teach me, right?

00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:40.060
I don't think I have time for that!

00:22:40.240 --> 00:22:41.080
Eat the face of a demon!

00:23:09.180 --> 00:23:12.080
I don't need any attack spells!

00:23:13.180 --> 00:23:14.280
I see.

00:23:14.500 --> 00:23:17.290
Then I'll just have to open my nose.

00:23:18.110 --> 00:23:18.330
Huh?

00:23:18.870 --> 00:23:23.610
Gaaaaaah!

00:23:23.610 --> 00:23:24.590
Gaaaaaah!

00:23:24.590 --> 00:23:24.690
Gaaaaaah!

00:23:24.690 --> 00:23:25.090
Gaaaaaah!

00:23:25.090 --> 00:23:29.840
Gaaaaaah!

00:23:43.440 --> 00:23:44.800
I wonder if he still doesn't know that this kind of thing doesn't apply to this Sabent's Naga!

00:23:47.960 --> 00:23:51.340
Ha ha ha! These guys are just time-consumers!

00:23:51.440 --> 00:23:52.620
Don't make fun of me!

00:23:53.620 --> 00:23:55.270
Take this, my king!

00:23:56.130 --> 00:23:56.920
Meteor!

00:23:57.260 --> 00:23:59.140
Meteor!

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:03.720
It's the magic spell of illusion that pours out the fragments of the stars floating in the air!

00:24:05.060 --> 00:24:06.570
The whole town is shaking!

00:24:07.330 --> 00:24:10.780
Don't look down on the ground from the sky!

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:13.340
Now is the time for that great power!

00:24:13.540 --> 00:24:14.620
Don't make me do it again!

00:24:18.830 --> 00:24:19.730
What!?

00:24:20.940 --> 00:24:21.620
What!?

00:24:21.620 --> 00:24:28.640
What!?

00:26:21.180 --> 00:26:22.120
I want to fight so that I can beat you again!

00:26:31.530 --> 00:26:35.260
I understand why this spell became an illusion.

00:26:37.960 --> 00:26:40.690
It seems that you can do a little.

00:26:41.110 --> 00:26:44.090
But you don't think you won with this, do you?

00:26:45.490 --> 00:26:49.840
No, I don't think so.

00:26:50.400 --> 00:26:56.160
I called blood for you.

00:27:00.480 --> 00:27:02.780
I think it's about time for you to show up.

00:27:03.820 --> 00:27:05.660
The meeting place is...

00:27:05.660 --> 00:27:06.640
...Beyazura!

00:27:30.280 --> 00:27:32.580
The strange people are coming from the foot of the mountain to this place!

00:27:33.620 --> 00:27:34.860
Maybe that's...

00:27:34.860 --> 00:27:38.450
Hey, wait a minute!

00:27:38.630 --> 00:27:40.610
You're the only one who's going to make it.

00:27:41.110 --> 00:27:43.110
Wait until those two come back.

00:27:43.510 --> 00:27:46.200
What if they don't wait until then?

00:27:46.600 --> 00:27:53.730
What are you fighting for?

00:27:53.810 --> 00:27:57.590
I want to live a life that I'm satisfied with myself.

00:28:19.420 --> 00:28:20.120
The hood!

00:28:20.380 --> 00:28:21.100
What are you doing?

00:28:25.596 --> 00:28:28.136
Eh?

00:28:28.284 --> 00:28:29.984
I can't do it, I can't do it

00:29:01.120 --> 00:29:03.340
I can't make it in time like this.

00:29:03.740 --> 00:29:06.390
If the people he called were in the village...

00:29:06.390 --> 00:29:21.640
You're not that kind of person.

00:29:21.970 --> 00:29:23.360
No, I'm not!

00:29:30.320 --> 00:29:34.500
Well, I'm sure I'm a bad old man, but I don't want to be a father who's got a daughter.

00:29:37.080 --> 00:29:59.980
You're going to solve the jutsu and talk to me like this?

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:00.320
What are you doing?

00:30:53.804 --> 00:30:55.804
Oh

00:31:51.020 --> 00:31:53.580
I'm a Muscovite!

00:32:04.890 --> 00:32:11.590
Don't tell me that I'm the most dangerous person in the world!

00:32:11.890 --> 00:32:26.480
You've come to save me, haven't you?

00:32:26.520 --> 00:32:27.550
My fellow soldiers.

00:32:32.300 --> 00:32:35.390
The time has come for you to seize my power!

00:32:35.390 --> 00:32:36.980
Come back to me!

00:32:37.780 --> 00:32:38.740
Give me your power!

00:32:39.880 --> 00:32:41.280
That man...

00:32:41.280 --> 00:32:42.420
It's you!

00:32:44.030 --> 00:32:46.290
What do you think you're doing?

00:32:46.770 --> 00:32:50.400
What are you doing?

00:32:51.450 --> 00:32:52.570
Damn you!

00:32:57.890 --> 00:32:59.190
I'll pay you back!

00:33:01.370 --> 00:33:07.160
What the hell are you doing?

00:33:07.160 --> 00:33:21.400
